+## 如何复验
+```
+# GET https://api.github.com/repos/Ji4n1ng/OpenInTerminal/releases/latest → v2.3.9
+curl -sSL -o OpenInTerminal-2.3.9.zip \
+  https://github.com/Ji4n1ng/OpenInTerminal/releases/download/v2.3.9/OpenInTerminal.zip
+shasum -a 256 OpenInTerminal-2.3.9.zip      # → 14df8720…7765
+mkdir v2.3.9 && unzip -q OpenInTerminal-2.3.9.zip -d v2.3.9   # unzip 会留下 __MACOSX/，ditto -x -k 不会
+codesign -dvvv v2.3.9/OpenInTerminal.app 2>&1 | grep -E 'Identifier|TeamIdentifier|Notarization'
+spctl -a -t exec -vv v2.3.9/OpenInTerminal.app    # → accepted, Notarized Developer ID
+swift run --package-path application-test feed-discover v2.3.9/OpenInTerminal.app
+#   → no Sparkle and no electron-builder update config
+swift run --package-path application-test channel-verify v2.3.9/OpenInTerminal.app --expect stable
+#   → winning source GitHub, latest 2.3.9, status up to date
+swift run --package-path application-test channel-verify v2.3.8/OpenInTerminal.app --expect stable
+#   → winning source GitHub, latest 2.3.9, status UPDATE → 2.3.9
+```
